// XGMII MAC datapath: 32-bit SDR TX + RX with term/error column (txc/rxc)
// TX: host bytes packed into 32-bit columns -> async FIFO -> txd/txc on
//     tx_clk; a partial last column (end of frame) pads with idle lanes
// RX: rxd/rxc on rx_clk -> byte ring; data lanes (rxc=0) are compacted
// Loopback-compatible. OpenCores ethernet/xgmii style.
// Auto-generated by gen_framework.py -- Apache-2.0
